{
 "id": "story-korsfestelsen-ballad",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/story-korsfestelsen-ballad",
 "offset_seconds": -4.640000000000157,
 "words_heard": 217,
 "words": 218,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "They met a man from Cyrene as they led the Lord away",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Simon bore the heavy cross up to the Skull that day",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They crucified him there between two rebels, left and right",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And cast lots for his clothing in the open morning light",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Father, forgive them",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For they do not know what they are doing",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Father, forgive them",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For they do not know what they are doing",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The rulers sneered, the soldiers mocked, the passers shook their heads",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.68,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He saved others, but he cannot save himself, they said",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 2.71,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "One criminal hurled insults from the cross there at his side",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 3.3,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But the other said, this man has done nothing wrong, and cried",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 2.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus, remember me when you come into your kingdom",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 3.83,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Truly I tell you, today you will be with me in paradise",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 4.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "From the sixth hour to the ninth a darkness fell on all the land",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 8.93,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The sun's light failed, and far away the watching women stand",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 6.85,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "My God, my God, why have you forsaken me, he cried",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 7.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And with a loud voice he called out once more before he died",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 8.01,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Father, into your hands I commit my spirit",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 14.21,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Father, into your hands I commit my spirit",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 19.77,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The curtain of the temple was torn in two",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 24.74,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Truly this was the Son of God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 21.51,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Father, forgive them",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 23.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  }
 ],
